  "citation": "West T; Brandt C; Wilson B; Hellwinckel C; Tyler D; Marland G; Ugarte D D L T; Larson J; Nelson R (2008): Estimated Annual Net Change in Soil Carbon per US County, 1990-2004. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/TCM.010",
  "dataset": {
